### Login as superadmin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get me
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tenants
GET http://localhost:4000/api/superadmin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create tenant
POST http://localhost:4000/api/superadmin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pendik Sofrası",
  "slug": "pendik-sofrasi"
}

### Create tenant admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/superadmin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pendik Admin",
  "email": "pendik.admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Tenant context (tenant_admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/context
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### List staff
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Create staff
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garson 1",
  "email": "garson1@example.com",
  "password": "staff123"
}

### Update staff
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garson 1",
  "email": "garson1@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Reset staff password
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/staff/{{staffId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpass123"
}

### Disable staff
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Update tenant profile
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pendik Sofrası",
  "description": "Aile restoranı"
}

### Categories - create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Yemekler",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Categories - list
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories?q=Ana&active=all
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Categories - update
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Yemekler",
  "sortOrder": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

### Categories - delete (soft)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### --- CANTEEN ISOLATION TESTS ---

### Login as platform admin (platform token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "platform@admin.com",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### platform token -> /api/canteen/branches => 403 forbidden_not_tenant_user
GET http://localhost:4000/api/canteen/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{platform_token}}

### Login as kermes tenant admin (restaurant token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pendik.admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### restaurant token -> /api/canteen/branches => 403 wrong_tenant_type
GET http://localhost:4000/api/canteen/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{restaurant_token}}

### Login as kantin tenant admin (canteen token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kantin.admin@example.com",
  "password": "kantin123"
}

### kantin token -> /api/canteen/branches => 200
GET http://localhost:4000/api/canteen/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{canteen_token}}

### kantin token -> /api/canteen/catalog/products (x-branch-id yok) => 403 missing_branch
GET http://localhost:4000/api/canteen/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{canteen_token}}

### kantin token + x-branch-id => 200
GET http://localhost:4000/api/canteen/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{canteen_token}}
x-branch-id: {{canteen_branch_id}}

### Categories - error name_in_use
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Yemekler",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Menu Items - create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "name": "Kebap",
  "price": 250,
  "description": "Lezzetli",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Menu Items - list
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/menu-items?categoryId={{categoryId}}&q=&active=all
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Menu Items - update
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/menu-items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "name": "Kebap",
  "price": 260,
  "description": "Usta işi",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "sortOrder": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

### Menu Items - delete (soft)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/menu-items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Category delete error when has items
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – create order
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – get order
GET http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – add item to order
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuItemId": "{{itemId}}"
}

### POS – remove item from order
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – set note
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/note
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Az acılı"
}

### POS – cancel order
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – send to kitchen
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – pay order
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "cash"
}

### POS – receipt DTO
GET http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – split order (partial payment preparation)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/split
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": "{{itemId}}", "qty": 1 }
  ],
  "targetTableId": "{{emptyTableId}}"
}

### POS – transfer order to another table
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/orders/{{orderId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetTableId": "{{targetTableId}}"
}

### Kitchen – list sent orders
GET http://localhost:4000/api/kitchen/orders?status=sent
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Kitchen – complete order
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Reports – summary
GET http://localhost:4000/api/reports/summary?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Reports – paid orders
GET http://localhost:4000/api/reports/orders?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Onboarding – setup status
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/setup-status
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Tables – list
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Tables – create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Masa 1"
}

### Tables – update
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/tables/{{tableId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Masa 1"
}

### Tables – delete (soft)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/tables/{{tableId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – start order from table
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pos/tables/{{tableId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – get table active order
GET http://localhost:4000/api/pos/tables/{{tableId}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### Audit – list with pagination
GET http://localhost:4000/api/tenant/audit?page=1&limit=20&action=order_pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}

### POS – merge tables (source into target)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/tables/{{targetTableId}}/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceTableIds": ["{{sourceTableId1}}","{{sourceTableId2}}"]
}

### Merge errors – invalid target (empty)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/tables/{{emptyTableId}}/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceTableIds": ["{{occupiedTableId}}"]
}

### Merge errors – invalid source (empty)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/pos/tables/{{occupiedTargetTableId}}/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceTableIds": ["{{emptyTableId}}"]
}
